<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/13th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Ganter</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1222">1222</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Ganter was fought in 1222 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/east-java">East Java</a> between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ken-arok">Ken Arok</a>, ruler of Tumapel, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kertajaya">Kertajaya</a>, king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kediri-kingdom">Kediri</a>. Ken Arok's victory ended the Kediri Kingdom and made him founder of the kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/singhasari">Singhasari</a> under the name Rajasa. The battle is known mainly from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pararaton">Pararaton</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nagarakretagama">Nagarakretagama</a>.</p></div>
